{"id":"433e9516a72135ee","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-set9-h-kappa.md","title":"ZFC Set9 H Kappa","display":"df-zfc-set9-h-kappa — ZFC Set9 H Kappa","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set9-h-kappa","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set9-h-kappa"],"display":"df-zfc-set9-h-kappa — ZFC Set9 H Kappa","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set9-h-kappa"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set9-h-kappa</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set9-h-kappa — ZFC Set9 H Kappa"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md\">../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md\">../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b2079cb7dec7ca43\" href=\"?note=b2079cb7dec7ca43\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TC}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{TC}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md\">../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\alpha\">\\(V_\\alpha\\)</span> (cumulative-hierarchy level, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md\">../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9HKappa}_S:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet9HKappa}_S:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\lambda\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b2079cb7dec7ca43\" href=\"?note=b2079cb7dec7ca43\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md</a>，为每个基数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 唯一确定后继基数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}h\\text{-}kappa}\\vdash\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)\\to\\mathrm{ZfcSet9HKappa}_S(\\kappa)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in V_\\lambda:|\\operatorname{TC}(\\{x\\})|&lt;\\kappa\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}h\\text{-}kappa}\\vdash\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)\\to\\mathrm{ZfcSet9HKappa}_S(\\kappa)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in V_\\lambda:|\\operatorname{TC}(\\{x\\})|&lt;\\kappa\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The rank bound <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\lambda\">\\(V_\\lambda\\)</span> turns the comprehension into an explicit set while containing every set of hereditary size below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"8c8abfb908cc9a24","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md","status":"resolved","id":"aabdf3005231e9dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"b2079cb7dec7ca43","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"tar